      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59297A7A5C0D623066FE7D935728000A53616D1B65AF573053406D41884C904E300200100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是只派上能在天空飛的寶可夢，\n還有能在空中飄的寶可夢<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n一較高下的寶可夢對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F53EA6D3E4E0A80FD572859297A7A98DB76845BF653EF5922FF0C000A9084670980FD57287A7A4E2D98C476845BF653EF592200100001BE00000A4E008F039AD84E0B76845BF653EF59225C0D6230300200100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的實力這麼強，\n一定能拿下天空對戰的王者寶座！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
